B.Vk=s(["Account data: name, email, and mobile number (optional).","Health and fitness data you enter: age, height, sex, weight, injury or postural issue, pain level, adherence days, sleep hours, daily habits and weekly check-in notes.","Training data: your program, completed exercises, goals, and messages between you and your coach.","Reports: when you report a message or account we keep the report and the reported message text only to review it.","We do not collect your location or contacts, and we use no advertising trackers."],t.s)
