B.Xq=s(["We keep your data while your account exists.","You can delete your account at any time in the app: Me \u2192 Delete account. This permanently deletes your profile, messages, check-ins and sign-in account.","When a coach deletes their account, their data and saved programs are deleted; each client keeps their own account and data.","You can withdraw your consent to data collection at any time by deleting your account; collection stops immediately."],t.s)
